       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Unloads the GnuCOBOL indexed files written by CBTRN02C back to
*> ASCII line-sequential files (key order), for golden-file comparison.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. UNLDKSDS.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT ACCT-IN  ASSIGN TO ACCTFILE ORGANIZATION INDEXED
           ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY AI-KEY.
    SELECT TCAT-IN  ASSIGN TO TCATBALF ORGANIZATION INDEXED
           ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY TI-KEY.
    SELECT TRAN-IN  ASSIGN TO TRANFILE ORGANIZATION INDEXED
           ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY TR-KEY.
    SELECT ACCT-OUT ASSIGN TO ACCTOUT ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT TCAT-OUT ASSIGN TO TCATOUT ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT TRAN-OUT ASSIGN TO TRANOUT ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD ACCT-IN.  01 AI-REC. 05 AI-KEY PIC X(11). 05 FILLER PIC X(289).
FD TCAT-IN.  01 TI-REC. 05 TI-KEY PIC X(17). 05 FILLER PIC X(33).
FD TRAN-IN.  01 TR-REC. 05 TR-KEY PIC X(16). 05 FILLER PIC X(334).
FD ACCT-OUT. 01 AO-REC PIC X(300).
FD TCAT-OUT. 01 TO-REC PIC X(50).
FD TRAN-OUT. 01 RO-REC PIC X(350).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN INPUT ACCT-IN OUTPUT ACCT-OUT
    MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ ACCT-IN NEXT AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END MOVE AI-REC TO AO-REC WRITE AO-REC END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE ACCT-IN ACCT-OUT
    OPEN INPUT TCAT-IN OUTPUT TCAT-OUT
    MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ TCAT-IN NEXT AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END MOVE TI-REC TO TO-REC WRITE TO-REC END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE TCAT-IN TCAT-OUT
    OPEN INPUT TRAN-IN OUTPUT TRAN-OUT
    MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ TRAN-IN NEXT AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END MOVE TR-REC TO RO-REC WRITE RO-REC END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE TRAN-IN TRAN-OUT
    GOBACK.
